# Rookery Stacks' egg-collectors' hollow under the gull stacks (CIPlay rookery_stacks_caves, 11-11; any world). Points as
# in its recipe (the origin frame): the mouth at -5 56 on the low west foot of the stacks; level east 8 m to a small
# room (about 3..9 56) under the west shoulder, 2 mushrooms inside. Dry, no air zone, no chest; the spikes stay.
island Rookery Stacks keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture rk_cave_out -14 4.5 56 -5 3 56
walk -10 56 to -5 56 to 0 56 to 6 56
picture rk_cave_in -3 4 56 7 3 56 light=20
wait 2
walk 6 56 to 0 56 to -5 56 to -10 56
